<title>USA: First Data acquires fax service firm.</title>
<headline>First Data acquires fax service firm.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Data Corp on Friday said that it has acquired privately-held Technology Solutions International Inc, an independent enhanced fax service bureau based in Atlanta.</p>
<p>TSI will operate as an independent, wholly-owned First Data subsidiary but will work in concert with First Data's Western Union Commercial Services message business, and market its services under the Western Union brand name.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
